        "TileImage": "$($repository e9f6dbe2-ae53-4181-a82c-dd52f20ba319).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning, Agent. \rWe&apos;ve tracked the Cyber Syndicate to Dubai&apos;s &apos;Sceptre&apos;. The prominent syndicate member by the codename of M4357r0 (Maestro) has been identified as Lamont Blackwood. Recovering his data chip has revealed that the syndicate has sent him to Dubai to overload the system&apos;s terminals (also called DDoS attacks) and use the disruption to deposit the emergency funds and steal them. Quite tricky to pull off, and we need to get to them before event security. \r\rBonne Chance, Agent.",
